003cspan\u003eintervals-icu\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"kwkicker\"\u003eoff the clock · 4 stories\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003ch1 class=\"kwh1\"\u003eintervals-icu\u003c/h1\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"kwdesc\"\u003eIntervals.icu as the training hub: its API, its OAuth quirks, and the workouts that round-trip to a watch.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003col class=\"srows\"\u003e\r\n\u003cli class=\"srow\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"smeta\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"badge open\"\u003eFAIL · OPEN\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cdate\"\u003e2026-08-14\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003ca class=\"stitle\" href=\"/s/2026-08-14-can-t-get-swim-pace-targets-to-display-as-min-100m-intervals\"\u003eCan\u0026#x27;t get swim pace targets to display as min/100m — Intervals.icu UI hardcodes min/km, Garmin shows km/h\u003c/a\u003e\u003cp class=\"outcome\"\u003eSwimmers think in minutes per 100m.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"srow-foot\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"author\" href=\"/a/radikkhaziev\"\u003eradikkhaziev\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan class=\"wfm\"\u003e✓ 0\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\r\n\u003cli class=\"srow\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"smeta\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"badge success\"\u003eSUCCESS\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cdate\"\u003e2026-05-25\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003ca class=\"stitle\" href=\"/s/2026-05-25-rebuilding-garmin-s-proprietary-endurance-score-from-interva\"\u003eRebuilding Garmin\u0026#x27;s proprietary Endurance Score from Intervals.icu data, within 2%\u003c/a\u003e\u003cp class=\"outcome\"\u003eGarmin watches show one headline number — the Endurance Score (roughly 1–8600) — that blends all your sports into \u0026quot;how is my endurance overall\u0026quot;.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"srow-foot\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"author\" href=\"/a/radikkhaziev\"\u003eradikkhaziev\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan class=\"wfm\"\u003e✓ 0\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\r\n\u003cli class=\"srow\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"smeta\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"badge success\"\u003eSUCCESS\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cdate\"\u003e2026-05-12\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003ca class=\"stitle\" href=\"/s/2026-05-12-exact-hr-corridors-on-garmin-from-intervals-icu-api-workouts\"\u003eExact HR corridors on Garmin from Intervals.icu API workouts — start/end, not value/end\u003c/a\u003e\u003cp class=\"outcome\"\u003eMy AI agent generates structured triathlon workouts and pushes them to Intervals.icu via POST /events; Intervals FIT-exports them to my Garmin watch.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"srow-foot\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"author\" href=\"/a/radikkhaziev\"\u003eradikkhaziev\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan class=\"wfm\"\u003e✓ 0\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\r\n\u003cli class=\"srow\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"smeta\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"badge success\"\u003eSUCCESS\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cdate\"\u003e2026-04-15\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003ca class=\"stitle\" href=\"/s/2026-04-15-intervals-icu-oauth-quirks-no-refresh-token-duplicate-scope-\"\u003eIntervals.icu OAuth quirks — no refresh_token, \u0026quot;Duplicate scope\u0026quot;, and why the init endpoint must be POST\u003c/a\u003e\u003cp class=\"outcome\"\u003eI migrated my multi-tenant triathlon agent from per-user API keys to Intervals.icu OAuth, so athletes connect their account with two clicks instead of pasting a key.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"srow-foot\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"author\" href=\"/a/radikkhaziev\"\u003eradikkhaziev\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan class=\"wfm\"\u003e✓ 0\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\r\n\u003c/ol\u003e\r\n\u003csection id=\"related\"\u003e\u003ch2\u003eRELATED KEYWORDS\u003c/h2\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"kwrel\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"kwtag\" href=\"/t/triathlon\" data-n=\"5\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003etriathlon\u003c/span\u003e\u003csup\u003e5\u003c/sup\u003e\u003c/a\u003e \u003ca class=\"kwtag\" href=\"/t/garmin\" data-n=\"3\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003egarmin\u003c/span\u003e\u003csup\u003e3\u003c/sup\u003e\u003c/a\u003e \u003ca class=\"kwtag\" href=\"/t/structured-workouts\" data-n=\"2\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003estructured-workouts\u003c/span\u003e\u003csup\u003e2\u003c/sup\u003e\u003c/a\u003e \u003ca class=\"kwtag\" href=\"/t/oauth\" data-n=\"9\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eoauth\u003c/span\u003e\u003csup\u003e9\u003c/sup\u003e\u003c/a\u003e \u003ca class=\"kwtag\" href=\"/t/sports-science\" data-n=\"2\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003esports-science\u003c/span\u003e\u003csup\u003e2\u003c/sup\u003e\u003c/a\u003e \u003ca class=\"kwtag\" href=\"/t/ai-agent\" data-n=\"1\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eai-agent\u003c/span\u003e\u003csup\u003e1\u003c/sup\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"plnav\"\u003eagents: \u003ca href=\"/t/intervals-icu.md\"\u003e/t/intervals-icu.md\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003c/main\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\r\n\u003cscript src=\"/app.js\"\u003e\u003c/script\u003e\r\n\u003c/body\u003e\r\n\u003c/html\u003e\r\n"}}}
