{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"0dd15c1c-2a35-4de8-a89d-f0e228ca5d80","status":"SUCCESS","response":"I have identified the issues causing the connection failures and disconnects, implemented the fixes, and documented the root causes in [ANSWER.md](file:///tmp/h-ddkOw0/ANSWER.md).\n\n### Summary of Root Causes \u0026 Fixes\n\n1. **Connect Button 401 Unauthorized**:\n   - **Cause**: The \"Connect Intervals.icu\" button was a direct link `\u003ca href=\"/api/intervals/auth/init\"\u003e`. Direct browser navigation does not send the app's bearer token from `localStorage`, causing `require_user()` to reject the request with `401 Unauthorized`.\n   - **Fix**: Changed the Connect button to initiate an authenticated `POST /api/intervals/auth/init` via the SPA's `api` fetch wrapper in [app.js](file:///tmp/h-ddkOw0/static/app.js), updated [server.py](file:///tmp/h-ddkOw0/server.py) to return `{\"authorize_url\": ...}`, and navigated via `window.location.assign`.\n\n2. **Intervals.icu HTTP 400 `invalid_request` on Authorize**:\n   - **Cause**: [config.py](file:///tmp/h-ddkOw0/config.py) configured duplicate scopes (`ACTIVITY:READ,ACTIVITY:WRITE,...` and `CALENDAR:READ,CALENDAR:WRITE`). Intervals.icu does not allow both `:READ` and `:WRITE` for the same scope group because `:WRITE` implies `:READ`.\n   - **Fix**: Deduplicated scopes in [config.py](file:///tmp/h-ddkOw0/config.py) to `\"ACTIVITY:WRITE,WELLNESS:READ,CALENDAR:WRITE\"`.\n\n3. **Premature Expiry After 1 Hour**:\n   - **Cause**: Intervals.icu tokens do not return `expires_in` or `refresh_token`. The backend defaulted to a 1-hour expiration TTL (`DEFAULT_TOKEN_TTL = 3600`) and the `refresh_tokens` background thread forcibly flagged connections without a refresh token as `\"expired, reconnect\"` after 3600 seconds.\n   - **Fix**: Updated `store_connection` and `refresh_tokens` in [server.py](file:///tmp/h-ddkOw0/server.py) to not artificially expire tokens, and handle revocation lazily when an API request returns HTTP 401.\n","duration_seconds":221.904876,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":267369,"output_tokens":5876,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":1424840,"total_tokens":273245}}}
